Citation: Kaur G, Singh HP, Batish DR, Mahajan P,
Kohli RK, Rishi V (2015) Exogenous Nitric Oxide
(NO) Interferes with Lead (Pb)-Induced Toxicity by
Detoxifying Reactive Oxygen Species in
Hydroponically Grown Wheat (Triticum aestivum)
Roots. PLoS ONE 10(9): e0138713. doi:10.1371/
